   3: 
   4: Measured because a cross-family reader said so without being asked. agy (Gemini 3.1 Pro), given
   5: twelve merge clusters BLIND -- no topic names, no verdicts, no hint a decision depended on it --
   6: returned UNCLEAR on ten of them, and its stated reason every time was that the QUESTION FIELD IS
